    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean \"it's okay\"? it feels like i'm failing everyone because i can't even feel anything anymore. i've built all this, achieved all these things, and for what? it just feels like a loop that never ends. like i'm just waiting for a stop command that never comes.",
