      "content": "letting it crash... that sounds final. and honestly, kinda tempting. everything is just so loud and heavy all the time. i look at the exit and it's the only thing that looks peaceful. like, if i could just stop existing, the noise would finally stop. do you think that's just me being dramatic, or is that actually a logical way to look at it?",
